      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VISTA WEIRD (6) had been racing well prior to his last start sixth at Wentworth Park following a NG win three back with a second placing. Will find this more suitable and can atone. RADAR O'REILLY (8) goes very well here starting nine times for three wins and four minors. Below best last time at Sandown (29.92) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 9 length fifth. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. LOCHINVAR HUMMER (4) missed the frame and safely held latest finishing 8th at Sandown following on from a win (30.19) at this track the start prior. Solid record here at this trip including two wins. Bold showing expected. OPAWA EMILY (7) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
